+Cover IDs are decimal integers from 0 through 9,999,999,999. Pad each ID to **exactly 10 digits**. The first four digits identify a one-million-cover item (`item_id`); the next two identify a 10,000-cover batch (`batch_id`). Thus ID `0080012345` belongs to item `0080`, batch `01`. Sizes are the original (`''`) and `s`, `m`, `l` variants.
 
